sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist<br/>(Notebook / CLI)
    participant SDK as Kubeflow SDK<br/>(Client Library)
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant TrainerOp as Trainer Operator<br/>(Server-side)
    participant Pod as Training Pod<br/>(Injected Code)
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Metrics as Metrics Endpoint<br/>28080/TCP HTTP
    participant HFHub as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ModelReg as Model Registry<br/>443/8080 TCP

    Note over User,ModelReg: Flow 1: Training Job Submission (TransformersTrainer)
    User->>SDK: trainer.train(model, dataset, config)
    SDK->>SDK: Serialize training code via<br/>inspect.getsource()
    SDK->>SDK: Inject progression tracking<br/>+ checkpoint instrumentation
    SDK->>K8s: POST TrainJob CR<br/>Auth: Bearer Token, TLS 1.2+
    K8s-->>SDK: TrainJob created
    K8s->>TrainerOp: Watch event: TrainJob
    TrainerOp->>Pod: Create JobSet / Pods<br/>with injected entrypoint
    Pod->>Metrics: Start HTTP metrics server<br/>:28080/TCP (no auth)
    Pod->>S3: Upload checkpoints<br/>Auth: AWS credentials, TLS
    Note over Pod,Metrics: Controller polls :28080<br/>for training progress JSON
    SDK->>K8s: GET TrainJob status<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8s-->>SDK: Training status + progress

    Note over User,ModelReg: Flow 2: Speculative Decoding Training
    User->>SDK: spec_trainer.train(model, config)
    SDK->>HFHub: GET model config<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN (optional), TLS 1.2+
    HFHub-->>SDK: Model config (auto-detect layers)
    SDK->>K8s: POST TrainJob CR<br/>(with vLLM sidecar spec)
    K8s-->>SDK: TrainJob created
    TrainerOp->>Pod: Create pods + vLLM sidecar
    Note over Pod: Training pod ↔ vLLM sidecar<br/>localhost:8234/TCP HTTP

    Note over User,ModelReg: Flow 3: Model Registration (Hub)
    User->>SDK: hub.register_model(model_info)
    SDK->>ModelReg: POST /api/model_registry/v1<br/>Auth: Bearer Token, TLS configurable
    ModelReg-->>SDK: Model registered
